  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "For this lesson, we will use this array 1 – 1, 2, 1, 0 – 2, 3 and k is 3.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 10000,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 300,
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "Our job is not to find one subarray, and we are not looking for the longest subarray.",
      "start_ms": 10640,
      "end_ms": 16160,
      "start_frame": 319,
      "end_frame": 485,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "We need to count every contiguous non -empty subarray, whose sum is exactly 3, for example.",
      "start_ms": 16460,
      "end_ms": 23840,
      "start_frame": 494,
      "end_frame": 715,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "2, 1 is contiguous, and its sum is 3, so that counts.",
      "start_ms": 23840,
      "end_ms": 29480,
      "start_frame": 715,
      "end_frame": 884,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "And the last value, 3, also counts.",
      "start_ms": 30100,
      "end_ms": 33360,
      "start_frame": 903,
      "end_frame": 1001,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "A single element can be a valid subarray.",
      "start_ms": 33840,
      "end_ms": 36940,
      "start_frame": 1015,
      "end_frame": 1108,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Now notice something important – our array contains negative numbers.",
      "start_ms": 37300,
      "end_ms": 41600,
      "start_frame": 1119,
      "end_frame": 1248,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "That means we cannot use the usual positive number logic, where the sum becomes too large.",
      "start_ms": 42120,
      "end_ms": 48260,
      "start_frame": 1264,
      "end_frame": 1448,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "So we immediately stop or shrink.",
      "start_ms": 48960,
      "end_ms": 51700,
      "start_frame": 1469,
      "end_frame": 1551,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, take 4 – 1 with target 3.",
      "start_ms": 51700,
      "end_ms": 57040,
      "start_frame": 1551,
      "end_frame": 1711,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "After reading 4, our sum is already greater than 3.",
      "start_ms": 57600,
      "end_ms": 61640,
      "start_frame": 1728,
      "end_frame": 1849,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "But if we continue, 4 plus minus 1 becomes 3.",
      "start_ms": 62220,
      "end_ms": 66500,
      "start_frame": 1867,
      "end_frame": 1995,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "So here, sum greater than k does not mean – this range can never become valid.",
      "start_ms": 66940,
      "end_ms": 73360,
      "start_frame": 2008,
      "end_frame": 2201,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Good.",
      "start_ms": 74060,
      "end_ms": 74560,
      "start_frame": 2222,
      "end_frame": 2237,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let us build the most straightforward correct solution.",
      "start_ms": 75100,
      "end_ms": 78460,
      "start_frame": 2253,
      "end_frame": 2354,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Pick one starting position.",
      "start_ms": 78940,
      "end_ms": 80520,
      "start_frame": 2368,
      "end_frame": 2416,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "From there?",
      "start_ms": 80520,
      "end_ms": 81860,
      "start_frame": 2416,
      "end_frame": 2456,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep extending the ending position to the right.",
      "start_ms": 82660,
      "end_ms": 85620,
      "start_frame": 2480,
      "end_frame": 2569,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Maintain a run and sum.",
      "start_ms": 86400,
      "end_ms": 87660,
      "start_frame": 2592,
      "end_frame": 2630,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Whenever that run and sum becomes equal to k, increase the answer.",
      "start_ms": 88540,
      "end_ms": 92980,
      "start_frame": 2656,
      "end_frame": 2789,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Once we finish that start, move the start one step to the right, reset the running sum, and repeat.",
      "start_ms": 93620,
      "end_ms": 101740,
